{"version":1,"content":"<p>PlayStation 3模擬器RPCS3的「Loadable」兼容類別現已沒有遊戲。開發團隊表示，Tom Clancy’s H.A.W.X. 2在修復SPU精度問題後，從「Loadable」升至「Ingame」，使這一類別首次自2023年以來再次歸零。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1584840.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T08:02:11.530307+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":132,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T07:52:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T07:58:38.660762+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T07:58:38.660762+00:00","content_hash":"e9e9aaf9d87535eb9ff88b90a99ea9b17d42786c4dfbd8471a84863ca3a9350c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}